==Battleground==
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has barely any way to supply money other than the first Owlbrows, which if you don't kill fast enough will stack up and serve as dangerous backliners sherdding your stack little by little. Additionally, the Elizabeth the LVIths have a level 3 [[Wave Attack]], sniping and killing your stack, which allows the White Cyclone to unleash their over A MILLION DPS which will shred all units in one second flat. And given how money tight this stage is combined with how hard White Cyclone pushes, you probably don't have the time or money to build a 2nd stack.

Luckily, there are some ways to minimize the threats. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can easily rush down the Owlbrows quite easily, though it may take some timing to chain the first few, and some precision for the last, it gives you lots of money to start your CC stack. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is a great unit for this level as it will block the Wave Attacks coming from the Elizabeths and can tank the Owlbrows, though falters against the cyclone.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] - A staple in most cyclone stages, a stack of them can perma-slow the White Cyclone and prevent it from pushing, though you have to protect them from the Wave Attacks or they won't live long, and given the nature of the stage you won't have the money or the time to build a second stack, so protect them as much as you can.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] - Can rush down the Owlbrows in the beginning and chip the cyclone. Just don't send them too often or they will drain your money.
*[[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] - The source of damage in most runs, deals heavy damage in stacks and can slowly whittle down the White Cyclone's 2 million HP and keeps the Elizabeths in check.
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] - Prevents the Wave Attacks from destroying your stack, and can tank any remaining Owlbrows, though don't stop sending them out, as the Elizabeths will kill him quickly.

